8. Code Review — Layering Check
Controller → injects ProductService only. Service → injects ProductRepository only, and contains
all business logic (fetch-modify-save for update, existence check for delete). Repository → a plain
JpaRepository, no logic. Grep confirms zero references to ProductRepository inside
ProductRestController.java, so the layering is correctly enforced.
